  "proposal": [
    "Add a trusted ordinary-module UI lifetime dispatcher before the ordinary-module early return, under the existing stable lock for PREPARE and SWITCH.",
    "Bind reviewed adapter/source/package identity to the loader-owned generation and complete image extent; no uploaded readiness flag, forged machine/table contribution, or resident DSP feature.",
    "Set trusted foreign_roots for admitted Tuner generations and refuse every retirement path when current or paused consumers hold that generation.",
    "Review and cover the window-manager registry/list and its close-callback field as well as input layer roots, both layer graphs, dispatch caches and module code/data/BSS aliases; fail closed on unknown state.",
